        "start_time": 12.4,
        "end_time": 20.2,
        "text": "Today we are practicing how to order food in Chinese. The key sentence is 我想要...",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_002",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 26.0,
        "end_time": 33.8,
        "text": "For drinks, we usually use the measure word 杯. Please repeat after me: 我想要一杯果汁。",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_003",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 45.0,
        "end_time": 51.6,
        "text": "How do you say 'I want a cup of juice' in Chinese?",
        "language_tags": ["en"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_004",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 58.1,
        "end_time": 67.2,
        "text": "Good try. Here we say 一杯果汁, not 一个果汁. 杯 is used for a cup or glass of drink.",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_005",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 82.3,
        "end_time": 92.5,
        "text": "Because 果汁 is a drink. In Chinese, drinks often use 杯. For noodles, we can say 一碗面条 or 一份面条.",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_006",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 108.4,
        "end_time": 116.2,
        "text": "Now try a full order: 我想要一杯果汁和一份面条。",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_007",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 134.0,
        "end_time": 143.8,
        "text": "Nice. After class, please record yourself reading 我想要一杯果汁和一份面条 five times.",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_008",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 145.1,
        "end_time": 154.6,
        "text": "Also review these words: 杯, 份, 碗, 果汁, 面条, 多少钱.",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "segment_id": "t_009",
        "speaker": "teacher",
        "start_time": 168.0,
        "end_time": 176.4,
        "text": "Next lesson, we will practice asking the price with 多少钱 and ordering without spicy food.",
        "language_tags": ["en", "zh-CN"],
        "asr_confidence": 0.95
      }
